          "value": "\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">[...] and two [...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...]a sofa (?)\u2014one dinar, ... five ... three [...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] ten dinars, muthallath cloth, a curtain(?) [...] two dinars</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] whose soul is at rest, a lamp\u2014three, two dyeing vessels and two jugs [...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] four dinars, a chest\u2014[...] dinar[s ...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] in the city of Tyre(?) a house of the sons of ... Ze\u02bfora</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] its [fo]ur quarters, one ... the first side\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[... ] the place of prayer and the gate of this house to its [...] side [... ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] this upper story. They total for her a sum of [...]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] (whose) s(oul is at) r(est;, \"I have received in full all [...\"]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[If ... should] desire to separate from her, he shall then pa[y ...]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[... spec]ified in this deed, and she shall not [...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] they shall inherit [your] ketu[bba] money [...]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] before you [...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">...\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">...\u00a0 </li></ol>\n",
